1
00:00:43,209 --> 00:00:46,533
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:49,536
=Episode 10=

3
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,320
Turn around.

4
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,360
Take off your mask.

5
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:08,800
Take it off!

6
00:01:16,760 --> 00:01:17,760
Hurry up!

7
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:26,760
I think my wound reopened.

8
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,480
Qingyuan!

9
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:34,400
My wound reopened. Didn't you hear me?

10
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,480
If it gets infected,

11
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:38,120
and the wedding can't happen tomorrow,

12
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,160
sponsors won't spare you.

13
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,560
Get the medicine!
What are you waiting for?

14
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,320
Is anyone there?

15
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:13,720
Nurse?

16
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,520
Lu Qingyuan?

17
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,800
What's going on?

18
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:22,080
Leaving me here all alone...

19
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:27,400
Ms. Xia Na, you're awake.

20
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,560
How are you feeling? Any discomfort?

21
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,880
I'm fine.

22
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,080
Move aside. I'm leaving.

23
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:35,400
Ms. Xia Na, you can't leave yet.

24
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:38,080
When you fainted earlier,
you showed signs of a concussion.

25
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:41,280
We need to run further tests.

26
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,160
Yes, a full-body checkup.

27
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:44,600
A concussion?

28
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,640
A full-body checkup?

29
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,000
Director Zhang,

30
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,040
I'm just a little dizzy.

31
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,840
It's not like I need surgery.

32
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,760
Why do I need a full-body checkup?

33
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:53,760
Out of my way!

34
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:54,920
Ms. Xia, you can't leave now.

35
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,560
Move! I'm leaving!

36
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,480
- Ms. Xia Na...
- What's going on?

37
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:01,000
Qingyuan, you've come just in time.

38
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,000
Director Zhang's lost it today.

39
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,080
He insisted on a full-body checkup,

40
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,080
and won't let me go.

41
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,480
I have a brand event this afternoon.

42
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:09,840
Take me back right now.

43
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:18,160
I had Director Li
cancel the brand event.

44
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:25,040
You look terrible. Just get some rest.

45
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,720
I'm really fine.

46
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:30,280
I'm not that fragile.

47
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,880
There's no need to hospitalize me.

48
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,280
Lu Qingyuan,
what is the meaning of this?

49
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:53,360
It means you need a minor procedure.

50
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,520
Sign it.

51
00:03:59,902 --> 00:04:01,890
(Surgical Consent Form)

52
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:07,240
Lu Qingyuan, are you insane?

53
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,320
How could I be a match for Mrs. Lu?

54
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,360
Xiaotang must be behind this.

55
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,480
She set me up.

56
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,040
Trust me.

57
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:16,120
Run the test again.

58
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,160
There must be a mistake.

59
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:22,720
Retesting won't change anything.

60
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,200
Just do the surgery.

61
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:26,680
I won't sign it!

62
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,680
Lu Qingyuan, this is a crime,
you know that?

63
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:30,680
Give her a shot.

64
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,200
- Calm her down.
- Let go of me!

65
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,720
Let me go!

66
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,080
- Sit still.
- No shots!

67
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,600
Let me go!

68
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:37,760
I... I'll sign!

69
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:43,080
I'll sign it.

70
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:45,600
Just don't inject me. No shots.

71
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:59,400
Lu Qingyuan,
you'll get what's coming to you!

72
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:00,880
You trash.

73
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,640
I'd rather die than sign it.

74
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:05,440
You piece of trash!
You use people and throw them away.

75
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:08,240
You never respected me
from the very start.

76
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,840
I never respect you?

77
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:16,680
Xia Na, don't act so high and mighty.

78
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,600
At least Gu Xiaotang makes me money.

79
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,600
What about you?

80
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:26,000
Giving up one kidney
will set you up for life.

81
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:28,840
That's way better
than sleeping with those executives.

82
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,480
Let go of me!

83
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:40,880
Let go! Let me go!

84
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:44,240
Lu Qingyuan!

85
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:57,600
Xiaotang, you need to get some sleep.

86
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,040
You haven't slept in two days.

87
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,160
If you keep this up,

88
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,960
you'll collapse
before you get your revenge.

89
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,000
I don't dare to sleep.

90
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:08,480
What if everything resets
once I fall asleep?

91
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,000
We've come so far with the plan.

92
00:06:12,520 --> 00:06:14,200
What if it all resets when I wake up?

93
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,240
Then everything will be in vain.

94
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,800
Then we'll start over again.

95
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,160
I'll be right there with you.

96
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:35,040
I mean...

97
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,040
Aren't we allies?

98
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,080
That's a true friend.

99
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:48,520
Do you think...

100
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,240
I can't...

101
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:58,880
fall asleep.

102
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:43,680
Great.

103
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,800
Time is still moving forward.

104
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,320
It didn't reset.

105
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,440
That's awesome!

106
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:55,320
Why... Why are you sleeping here?

107
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,360
I...

108
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:00,920
Good morning.

109
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,760
We made it through.

110
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,200
Good morning.

111
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,880
Sorry about that.

112
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:18,760
Why do you think it didn't reset
when we woke up this time?

113
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:21,840
Looks like the loop only triggers
if we fall asleep

114
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,840
at the wedding,

115
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:24,840
or if we die.

116
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,480
That means,

117
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,120
before the next wedding,

118
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,720
we have plenty of safe time.

119
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,840
Great! Since that's the case,

120
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:39,240
I can settle the score
with them properly.

121
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:53,040
Your brother called from overseas again
this morning.

122
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:56,720
He said he contacted
the top medical center in the US.

123
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:59,360
They have top specialists and equipment.

124
00:09:59,360 --> 00:10:01,240
He wanted to fly me over for surgery.

125
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:03,480
He said it's safer.

126
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:06,320
Mom, you can't go abroad.

127
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:08,000
Is going abroad really foolproof?

128
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,520
You don't know anyone there,
and you don't speak English.

129
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:12,960
If something goes wrong,

130
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:15,320
we'd be totally on our own.

131
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,080
My brother
is only living there temporarily.

132
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,560
How could he take care of everything?

133
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:19,560
He took it for granted.

134
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:20,960
But...

135
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:26,160
Mom, the match is right here.

136
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:28,680
Xia Na's kidney
has been verified multiple times.

137
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:29,680
Let's do it here.

138
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,080
Most importantly,

139
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:34,400
I want to see you
make it out of surgery safely.

140
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:35,680
Promise me, okay?

141
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,840
But didn't you say before

142
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:40,280
that Gu Xiaotang was my match?

143
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:42,560
We went through all that trouble
to marry her in.

144
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:44,120
Why is it suddenly Xia Na?

145
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:47,400
Don't worry. They made a mistake before.

146
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:48,400
It's foolproof this time.

147
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:51,880
Alright. You've thought of everything.

148
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,120
Such a good son.

149
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,560
I didn't raise you for nothing.

150
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,720
Alright, I'll do as you say.

151
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,200
Let's do it here.

152
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:00,400
Okay, Mom.

153
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:05,200
How about this?
To avoid any complications,

154
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:08,360
let's do the surgery
before my wedding with Xiaotang.

155
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:09,720
It'll bring good fortune.

156
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,880
Fine, make the arrangements.

157
00:11:11,880 --> 00:11:12,880
Okay.

158
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,800
Mr. Lu, do you mean

159
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:25,920
we must operate on your mother
before the wedding?

160
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:31,120
That useless brother of mine
is getting desperate.

161
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:33,800
He wants credit
for saving my mother's life.

162
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:37,000
My father died suddenly

163
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,320
without finalizing his will.

164
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:41,720
Whoever saves my mother
takes control of the Lu family.

165
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:45,400
So we must do the surgery

166
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:46,520
before he takes her abroad.

167
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,960
Understood.

168
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:51,040
Mr. Lu.

169
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:54,520
What is it?

170
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:55,560
Mr. Lu,

171
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:58,560
can you tell me
what's going on with Xia Na?

172
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,680
Didn't I tell you?

173
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:03,760
I have plans for her.

174
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:06,080
But you already bought Gu Xiaotang.

175
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,400
If Xia Na doesn't come back,

176
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,480
I'm afraid our company...

177
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:13,600
I'm keeping your company alive.

178
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:15,760
Why are you so worked up?

179
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:19,400
I wouldn't dare.

180
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:22,960
Remember.
Know your place and stay on your leash.

181
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:24,800
Don't worry

182
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,120
about anything else.

183
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,200
Get out.

184
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,560
Come on. Have a drink, sweetie.

185
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:58,120
You lost, so drink up!

186
00:12:58,120 --> 00:13:00,760
Mr. Wang, I'm sorry.
I really can't drink.

187
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,080
Drink!

188
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:09,960
What is wrong with you?

189
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:12,040
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

190
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,680
Director Li, deal with her!

191
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:17,680
Mr. Wang, don't be mad.

192
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,360
She's inexperienced. I'll teach her.

193
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,240
Drink it.

194
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,000
Drink it now!

195
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,680
I really can't drink.

196
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:41,840
Because of useless trash like you,

197
00:13:41,840 --> 00:13:45,320
I have to act like a lapdog
in front of Lu Qingyuan!

198
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,960
You can't drink, huh?

199
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,960
Fine, I'll teach you.

200
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:51,560
Come on, drink! Drink!

201
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,720
Drink it! Drink it!

202
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,480
Good.

203
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:58,640
Gu Xiaotang?

204
00:14:29,736 --> 00:14:33,092
♪The face deep in the heart♪

205
00:14:33,284 --> 00:14:35,746
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

206
00:14:37,121 --> 00:14:40,821
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

207
00:14:41,032 --> 00:14:43,472
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

208
00:14:43,619 --> 00:14:45,991
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

209
00:14:46,141 --> 00:14:48,898
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

210
00:14:48,898 --> 00:14:51,219
♪Even for just a second♪

211
00:14:52,564 --> 00:14:56,027
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

212
00:14:56,155 --> 00:14:58,004
♪And sunlight reverses♪

213
00:14:58,004 --> 00:15:01,474
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

214
00:15:01,830 --> 00:15:03,904
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

215
00:15:04,406 --> 00:15:07,815
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

216
00:15:08,072 --> 00:15:13,284
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

217
00:15:14,538 --> 00:15:17,103
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

218
00:15:17,145 --> 00:15:20,598
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

219
00:15:21,175 --> 00:15:24,138
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

220
00:15:24,883 --> 00:15:27,491
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

221
00:15:27,491 --> 00:15:31,114
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

222
00:15:31,584 --> 00:15:35,640
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
